  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernisation of the bee and honey sector of Burundi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal of the project is to develop the beekeeping and honey sector in Burundi.The joint venture will target new associations of beekeepers not yet involved with the local partner, provide them with modern hives and train them in order to improve the quality and quantity produced.A collection centre will be set up where the honey and other bee products will be processed (beeswax, propolis and royal jelly).The company will start a bee selection programme which will allow improving the honey collection behaviour of indigenous bee.The collection centre will be based in Bujumbura and beekeepers will be involved from several provinces of northern Burundi.</narrative>
  </description>
